  null,
  {
   "settings": {
    "dialog": [
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "Swords, knuckles, cards...\\. Only a few firearms.",
       "transl": "Schwerter, Schlagringe, Karten...\\. Aber kaum Knarren."
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "Man, why is it so tough to be a \\c[5]gunner\\c[0] in MMOs nowadays?",
       "transl": "Kehr, warum wird es einem als \\c[5]Schütze\\c[0] in MMOs heutzutage so schwer gemacht?"
      },
      "event": [
       {
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "person": {
         "person": "cross-worlds.hexacast-male-black",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Hi!",
         "transl": "Привіт!"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Oh, hey.\\. I was just doing some window-shopping here.",
         "transl": "Oh, hey.\\. Ich schau mir hier gerade die Auslagen an."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "cross-worlds.hexacast-male-black",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "For a sci-fi game, CrossWorlds has an astounding lack of guns, don't you think?",
         "transl": "Für ein Sci-Fi-Spiel hat CrossWorlds verdammt wenig Knarren, findest du nicht auch?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "cross-worlds.hexacast-male-black",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "...",
         "transl": "..."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "SURPRISED_AWAY"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "It's a shame, too.\\. My class is the ranged option, but...\\. I'm not made for support.",
         "transl": "Eine Schande.\\. Hinzu kommt, dass meine Klasse distanzbasiert ist, ich aber gar kein Supporter bin."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "cross-worlds.hexacast-male-black",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Can't we have a Septaranger, or something?",
         "transl": "Warum gibt es keinen Septaranger oder sowas?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "cross-worlds.hexacast-male-black",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "...",
         "transl": "..."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "SMILE"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Not that you'd agree, anyway.\\. You're a Spheromancer.",
         "transl": "Das kannst du wahrscheinlich nicht nachvollziehen, weil du ein Spheromancer bist."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "cross-worlds.hexacast-male-black",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "But I can't be stylish while throwing balls.\\. That's, like, anti-fun, you know?",
         "transl": "Aber wie soll ich denn bitte stilvoll Bälle werfen?\\. Das sieht doch affig aus!"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "cross-worlds.hexacast-male-black",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "...??",
         "transl": "...??"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "ANNOYED"
        }
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "settings": {
    "dialog": [
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "Look! That guy just took a Cobalt Mail out of the display case and put it on!",
       "transl": "Sieh mal! Der Typ da hat einen Kobaltharnisch aus der Vitrine genommen und ihn angezogen!"
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "I don't think the shopkeep noticed...",
       "transl": "Glaube nicht, dass der Ladenbesitzer das gesehen hat..."
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "Uh...\\. doesn't he realize that won't work?\\. You have to literally go up to the counter to buy the thing.",
       "transl": "Öh...\\. Der weiß wohl nicht, dass das nicht funktionieren wird?\\. Man muss direkt an den Tresen, um Dinge zu kaufen."
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "It's going to disappear from his inventory as soon as he walks away from the case.",
       "transl": "Sie verschwinden in dem Moment aus seinem Inventar, in dem er den Laden verlässt."
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "It disappears?\\. Oh...\\. oh no.",
       "transl": "Sie verschwinden?\\. Oh...\\. Heißt das etwa..."
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "What? You don't think he has the Visible Armor setting enabled, do you?",
       "transl": "Was? Sag bloß, er hat die Einstellung deaktiviert, die seine Rüstung sichtbar macht?"
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "...",
       "transl": "..."
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "Oh...\\. oh wow.",
       "transl": "Oha...\\."
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "Purple chest hair?\\. Really?",
       "transl": "Lila Brusthaare?\\. Echt jetzt?"
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "Some people shouldn't be allowed near character creators.",
       "transl": "Manche Leute sollte man wirklich von Charakter-Editoren fernhalten."
      }
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  null,
  {
   "settings": {
    "dialog": [
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "Have you come up with your character for our Pen&Paper evening already?",
       "transl": "Hast du dir schon einen Charakter für unseren Pen&Paper-Abend überlegt?"
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "Yeah, I guess I'm going to be an amazon warrior from Maraskan, who tries to find her lost tribe.",
       "transl": "Ja, ich werd eine Amazone aus Maraskan spielen, die ihren verlorenen Stamm wiederfinden will."
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "Sounds great. What's the name of your character?",
       "transl": "Klingt super. Wie willst du sie nennen?"
      }
     },
     {
      "text": {
       "orig": "I didn't come up with a good name yet. I'm really not good with \\c[5]naming my characters\\c[0].",
       "transl": "Weiß ich noch nicht. Tue mich immer schwer damit, mir \\c[5]Namen auszudenken\\c[0]."
      },
      "event": [
       {
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "person": {
         "person": "cross-worlds.pentafist-female-blue",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Hi!",
         "transl": "Привіт!"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Oh, hello. I guess you heard all that... do you have a suggestion for my character's name?",
         "transl": "Oh, hallo. Möchtest du mir helfen, einen Namen für meine Amazone zu finden?"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "cross-worlds.pentafist-female-blue",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "[nods]",
         "transl": "[киває]"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "NOD"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Lea!",
         "transl": "Лія!"
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "main.lea",
         "expression": "PROUD"
        }
       },
       {
        "message": {
         "orig": "Mmh, Lea...\\. Lea the amazon warrior...",
         "transl": "Mmh, Lea...\\. Lea die Amazone..."
        },
        "person": {
         "person": "cross-worlds.pentafist-female-blue",
         "expression": "DEFAULT"
        }
       },
       {
